* SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
* mathieeedoubbas.library (NDK mathieeedoubbas_lib.fd), in the C900
* dialect of exec_lib.fd.  Each function takes MathIeeeDoubBasBase as its
* first argument.
##base _MathIeeeDoubBasBase
##bias 30
##public
IEEEDPFix(parm)(double) LONG @mbfix
IEEEDPFlt(integer)(LONG) double @mbflt
IEEEDPCmp(leftParm,rightParm)(double,double) LONG @mbcmp
IEEEDPTst(parm)(double) LONG @mbtst
IEEEDPAbs(parm)(double) double @mbabs
IEEEDPNeg(parm)(double) double @mbneg
IEEEDPAdd(leftParm,rightParm)(double,double) double @mbadd
IEEEDPSub(leftParm,rightParm)(double,double) double @mbsub
IEEEDPMul(factor1,factor2)(double,double) double @mbmul
IEEEDPDiv(dividend,divisor)(double,double) double @mbdiv
IEEEDPFloor(parm)(double) double @mbfloor
IEEEDPCeil(parm)(double) double @mbceil
##end
